  "question": {
    "text": "A large tank filled with water to a height <math><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;is to be emptied through a small hole at the bottom. The ratio of time taken for the level of water to fall from <math><mi>h</mi></math> to <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and from <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> to zero is"
  },
